fix(ui): hide the calls-tab options while the iOS tab layout is on

With MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS the Calls tab is never shown, so the call list
must not offer "Show in main tabs" or "Hide call tab", and must not show
the "tap to hide the calls tab" hint. Before this change these options
were visible but had no effect.

- MainTabsActivity: MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS is public, so other screens can
  read it.
- CallLogActivity: the button, the menu item and the hint check it.
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/MainTabsActivity.java
>>> find
private static final boolean MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS = true;
>>> replace
public static final boolean MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS = true;
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/CallLogActivity.java
>>> find
if (!getUserConfig().showCallsTab) {
>>> replace
if (!MainTabsActivity.MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS && !getUserConfig().showCallsTab) {
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/CallLogActivity.java
>>> find
if (!hideCallTabsHintWasShown && getUserConfig().showCallsTab
>>> replace
if (!MainTabsActivity.MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS && !hideCallTabsHintWasShown && getUserConfig().showCallsTab
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/CallLogActivity.java
>>> find
if (getUserConfig().showCallsTab) {
>>> replace
if (!MainTabsActivity.MYCLIENT_IOS_TABS && getUserConfig().showCallsTab) {
